# Frenzied Trapbreaker: "Whenever this creature attacks, destroy target artifact or enchantment defending player controls."
# When a creature attacks a battle, the defending player is the battle's protector (CR 508.5, 310.9d). Turn 5 (night) Bot1
# casts Invasion of Gobakhan, which Bot2 protects, and attacks it with the Trapbreaker: Bot2's Mox Jet and Mox Emerald are
# candidates (two, so the choice is asked) and Bot1's own Mox Ruby is not (the refusal). The Jet is destroyed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Outland Liberator
Invasion of Gobakhan
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Swamp x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Outland Liberator.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Invasion of Gobakhan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Frenzied Trapbreaker > Bot1.Battlefield.Invasion of Gobakhan)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Emerald
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = true
